OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy at first with
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain clearing east.
OL,7,FThen turning brighter with a few
OL,8,Fscattered showers. Strong to near gale
OL,9,Fforce southwesterly winds soon veer
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few scattered showers
OL,13,Falongside strong northwesterly winds
OL,14,Fwhich will gradually decrease through
OL,15,Fthe night. Turning mainly dry later
OL,16,Fwith some clear spells for Shetland,
OL,17,Fbut Orkney cloudier.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
