OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA risk of patchy rain early
OL,6,Ffor Orkney and a few showers for
OL,7,FShetland, otherwise largely dry with
OL,8,Fsome sunny spells.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FAn
OL,11,Fchangeable period, often cloudy with
OL,12,Fthe risk of rain or showers. Rain
OL,13,Fpossibly heavy at times, but becoming
OL,14,Fgenerally drier and brighter through
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
